{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6c9397d2-fe12-8721-9d69-36e6443e56c6",
  "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:40:36-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Marisa Pina",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T10:38:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T10:38:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes, good morning. I'm calling about the road in front of my house. It's, um, there's a dip, a bad one, and it's not the first time I'm calling about this kind of thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T10:38:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sorry about that. What's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T10:38:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "136 Bliss Road. Down near Easton's Beach side. Can you hear me? I'm in the car, the signal is [line breaks up]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T10:38:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You cut out on me right at the end there. Did you say 136 Bliss Road?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T10:38:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, 136 Bliss Road. Bliss. B-L-I-S-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T10:38:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 136 Bliss. So, a dip in the road. Is it a pothole or more of a sunken spot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T10:38:54-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sunken. They dug a trench there for the utility, the gas or the cable, I don't know which one, and they filled it, and now it settled. So there's a long dip, and every car bangs down in it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T10:39:06-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a utility trench that settled. I'm writing that down. Is it off to the side or in the travel lane?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T10:39:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right in the bike lane. Right in it. Somebody on a bicycle is going to go over the handlebars. I've watched them swerve out into the cars to get around it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T10:39:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's not good. Bike lane, settled trench, in front of 136."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T10:39:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. And I want the street added to the repair list. Because nobody fixes these things after the utility leaves. They leave the mess and go. [crosstalk]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T10:39:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up again. You want it added to the repair list, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T10:39:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the repair list. Please put it on. I'm tired of waiting."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T10:39:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in the request now with the location and the bike lane part, so the crew sees it's a safety thing. I can't give you a day it'll get done, but it'll be in the system."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T10:39:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. [pause] Hold on. Ô, dexa-m'... no, ka bu ta fazê li? Sorry, my brother is asking me something. [pause] I'm back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T10:40:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Is 401-555-0198 the best number if the crew has questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T10:40:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's the one. That's my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T10:40:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Anything else on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T10:40:12-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, only that. Well, I'm standing here looking at all the leaves in the yard, and I'm thinking maybe I buy a leaf blower. But then I think no, it's loud, it's money. I go back and forth. Sorry, that's not for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T10:40:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, no worries, can't help you there. Okay, you're all set, Ms. Pina. The request is in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T10:40:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Please, just get somebody out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T10:40:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Take care."
    }
  ],
